WEBVTT

00:00:27.648 --> 00:00:30.318
we keep ourselves so busy
and distracted to begin with.

00:00:30.318 --> 00:00:32.570
But we don't know what to do about it.

00:00:32.987 --> 00:00:36.866
So I'm here to tell you
I figured out what to do about it.

00:00:37.992 --> 00:00:40.745
We need to have more fun.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:42.830
(Laughter)

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:46.459
(Cheers and applause)

00:00:46.501 --> 00:00:50.213
So you might think that you're already
having plenty of fun,

00:00:50.213 --> 00:00:52.256
and that's because in our everyday speech,

00:00:52.298 --> 00:00:56.552
we often use the word "fun" to describe
anything we do with our leisure time,

00:00:56.594 --> 00:01:00.139
even if it's not actually enjoyable,
and, in fact, a waste of time.